PC PC_VM2 {} @ VM2
   process VM2 @ coin
   atom :'coin'
   after coin->Op2229ce7e
   operator Op2229ce7e.Choice
   op_connector Op2229ce7e->water
   op_connector Op2229ce7e->choc
   atom :'water'
   after water->Ref20286a6b
   atom :'choc'
   after choc->Ref20286a6b
   reference Ref20286a6b
   ref_connector Ref20286a6b->VM2
